<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - IBM &quot;featured stock&quot;.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - IBM &quot;featured stock&quot;.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- CS First Boston said it named International Business Machines Corp as its &quot;featured stock of the week.&quot;</p>
<p>-- expects IBM to earn $12.25 a share in 1997 and $14.30 a share in 1998.</p>
<p>-- reiterated a price target of $165 a share, but said there are signals that the stock could trade higher than that price.</p>
<p>-- said IBM is managing to differentiate itself from its competitors.</p>
<p>-- said IBM will host a meeting with certain analysts on May 7 that could generate positive enthusiasm.</p>
<p>-- IBM gained 3/8 to 162-5/8 in early trading.</p>
</text>
